                        "entry_id": "d6667c87-153a-3579-acc1-c6f9ac0006e5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "female equivalent of охрани́тель (oxranítelʹ): female protector, protectress"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "547f193a-912e-43a5-b642-2d4bbd28eaff",
                                "sense_id": "bb8549db-a80c-32f3-9db8-e32bc3cd07d6",
                                "text": "— Ниче́м вы ему́ не обя́заны, — говори́ли нам на́ши охрани́тельницы, — а напро́тив, э́то он-то всё и наде́лал.",
                                "translation": "“You owe him nothing,” our protectresses said. “On the contrary, it was he who caused it all.”",
                                "english": "“You owe him nothing,” our protectresses said. “On the contrary, it was he who caused it all.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
